Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.31,0:20:07.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,他用很了多银钉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, he used a lot of silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.31,0:20:09.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们有麻烦了…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're having difficulty...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.31,0:20:11.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,叫弗劳斯特进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Send in Frost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,狄肯·弗劳斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deacon Frost.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.33,0:20:25.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can come in now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.90,0:20:39.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是吸血族的耻辱 弗劳斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.17,0:20:41.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们若违反条约
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.17,0:20:44.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,或是聚众集会
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.67,0:20:48.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,人类政府就会找我们麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:54.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,你若是纯种吸血鬼就会了解
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:58.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋已经够麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.36,0:21:02.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的舞厅太危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These nightclubs of yours are dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:03.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.30,0:21:06.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,引来太多注意力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They draw needless attention to our kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:10.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你知道规矩  - 那不是我的规矩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You know our policy.  - Your policy, not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.31,0:21:12.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了生存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our livelihood...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.31,0:21:16.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须融入人群...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}depends on our ability to blend in...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.31,0:21:19.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,安分守己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and our discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.31,0:21:23.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,别再这么孬种了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe it's time we forgot about discretion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:25.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们应该统治人类...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should be ruling the humans...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.32,0:21:28.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是跟他们签什么条约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not running around making back-alley treaties with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:32.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,人类是我们的食物 不是盟友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For fuck's sake, these people are our food not our allies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.33,0:21:34.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你太过份了  - 是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're out of line.  - Am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.33,0:21:38.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许我说出你们心里的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or maybe I'm just the first to say out loud what we've all been thinkin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:42.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,几千年来我们都是这样生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have existed this way for thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.34,0:21:47.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,你凭什么批评我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you to challenge our ways?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.34,0:21:51.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不是纯种吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not even a pureblood.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.35,0:21:55.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,这重要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like it matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.35,0:22:00.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我生来就是吸血鬼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was born a vampire...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.36,0:22:04.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,每位长老都跟我一样...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as was every other member of this house...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.29,0:22:06.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,可是你 弗劳斯特...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, you, Frost...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.30,0:22:11.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不过是半路出家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you were merely turned.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.30,0:22:17.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,世界是我们的 不是人类的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world belongs to us not the humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.31,0:22:19.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.31,0:22:28.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有什么事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do we have any other business to discuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.32,0:22:31.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈海外帐户\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's the matter of our offshore accounts.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.32,0:22:34.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有转帐…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And have you made the transfer to...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.32,0:22:35.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,盖塔罗...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gitano...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.32,0:22:39.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,有一天你会发现你已绝种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you may wake up one day and find yourself extinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.68,0:23:05.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,(蒜精)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.29,0:23:14.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你来早了一礼拜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a week early.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.69,0:23:15.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.30,0:23:27.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,惠斯勒说 我对血清产生抵抗力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whistler says I'm building up a resistance to the serum.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.31,0:23:32.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我早知道会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I figured that might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.32,0:23:42.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要保重?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You take care, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.29,0:25:29.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我老了心也软...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must be getting soft in my old age...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.30,0:25:33.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,竟然让你带她回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ietting you bring home a stray like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.30,0:25:38.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你这么做很蠢 也许是好事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was damn stupid of you. Might've lucked out, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.31,0:25:41.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我查过她的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I checked her background.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.31,0:25:46.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,她是血液学医师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It turns out she's a hematologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.32,0:25:50.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许能帮我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She might be useful to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.32,0:25:53.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我看不见得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.32,0:25:56.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是说真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.32,0:25:58.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我看过她的笔记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took a look at that notebook of hers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.33,0:26:00.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,她有所发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's onto something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.27,0:26:06.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我得增加剂量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to increase the dose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.27,0:26:10.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,五十多毫克 越来越危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over 50 milligrams now. That's getting dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.27,0:26:13.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,快注射吧 老头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do it, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.27,0:27:16.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,迷路了吗 大夫?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wander off the beaten path, doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.27,0:27:21.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们是什么人?  - 我叫亚伯拉汗·惠斯勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you people?  - My name's Abraham Whistler.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.28,0:27:24.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你见过刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've met Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.30,0:27:44.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是囚犯吗?  - 不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So, am I a prisoner here?  - Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.30,0:27:50.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是需要做好预防措施才能放你走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just had to take certain precautions before we let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.31,0:27:53.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要知道 他们无所不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got to understand they're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.31,0:27:55.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampires...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.31,0:27:57.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,夜行人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the hominus nocturna.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.31,0:27:59.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们猎杀他们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hunt them, you see...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.31,0:28:03.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,从一个城市到另一个城市 追踪他们的活动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}moving from one city to the next tracking their migrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.25,0:28:06.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们能重生 很难赶尽杀绝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're hard to kill. They tend to regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.25,0:28:08.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,难道我会相信吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm supposed to believe all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.26,0:28:11.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在医院见过烤肉先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already met Mr. Crispy at the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.26,0:28:13.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你说呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.26,0:28:17.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,用什么武器?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what do you use, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.27,0:28:21.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 木棍? 十字架?  - 十字架没有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Stakes? Crosses?  - Crosses don't do squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.27,0:28:24.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过有些传说是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of the legends are true, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.27,0:28:28.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼对银过敏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampires are severely allergic to silver.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.28,0:28:31.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,碰到大蒜也会过敏性休克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Feed them garlic and they go into anaphylactic shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.28,0:28:36.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们也怕阳光 紫外线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, of course, there's always sunlight, ultraviolet rays.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.28,0:28:41.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我做了这玩意 今晚试试吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got this sucker running. You want to give it a try tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.29,0:28:48.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,太重了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's still heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.30,0:28:51.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你这么壮 还在乎吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you're so big.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.30,0:28:56.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要是想再多活一天 就在天黑前赶快离开这小镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to live to see another day you'll be out of town by nightfall.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.30,0:28:59.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要去哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So where am I supposed to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.24,0:29:05.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们认得你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've been exposed to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.25,0:29:10.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,或早或晚 他们一定会派人杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One way or another, somebody's going to take you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.25,0:29:18.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是一场大战 我 刀锋和少数战士...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a war going on out there. Blade, myself, a few others...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.26,0:29:22.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,试着阻止他们危害人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we've tried to keep it from spilling over onto the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.26,0:29:26.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,你这种人只是倒霉被扯进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes, people like yourself get caught in the cross fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.27,0:29:29.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有血液样本 我去报警\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have blood samples. I can go to the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.27,0:29:31.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,警察被他们收买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They own the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.27,0:29:35.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,要知道 他们无孔不入\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to understand, they're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.28,0:29:38.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你一定见过他们 只是你不知道而已…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chances are you've seen them yourself and didn't know it...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.28,0:29:41.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,地铁站 酒吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the subway or in a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.28,0:29:43.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,就这样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.29,0:29:48.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,帮我包扎好就叫我滚蛋?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys just patch me up and send me on my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.29,0:29:54.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,拿去 防吸血鬼喷液…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here. Vampire mace...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.30,0:29:59.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,银亚硝酸盐和蒜精\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}silver nitrate, essence of garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.30,0:30:03.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛睁大点 小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep your eyes open. Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.31,0:30:08.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有一件事…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One other thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.31,0:30:11.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,买一把枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}buy yourself a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.31,0:30:16.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,当你开始怕阳光...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you start getting sensitive to daylight...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.32,0:30:21.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,无论喝多少水都觉得渴...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you find you're thirsty, regardle how much you had to drink...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.32,0:30:26.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我就建议你举枪自尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then I suggest you take that gun and use it on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.33,0:30:32.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,总比变吸血鬼好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Better that than the alternative.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.32,0:31:31.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我警告过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have been warned before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.33,0:31:36.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,资料库只能让长老使用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These archives are restricted to the members of the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.33,0:31:42.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在浪费时间 这种语言已失传\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are wasting your time. It's a dead language.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.34,0:31:46.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,无法翻译这些古书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ancient texts can never be translated.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.34,0:31:50.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,反正你也看不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't even understand them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.35,0:31:54.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死的 弗劳斯特 我在跟你说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn it, Frost! I'm talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.35,0:32:01.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,小声点 盖塔罗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your voice down, Gitano.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.29,0:32:06.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是图书馆 请勿高声喧哗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're in a library. You don't need to shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.29,0:32:08.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你在打什么主意 弗劳斯特?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you up to, Frost?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.31,0:32:23.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你能把我怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.32,0:32:29.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.32,0:32:36.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没这能耐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You bore me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.29,0:33:13.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,记住我们说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember what we told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.29,0:33:17.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛放亮点 他们无所不在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep your eyes open. They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.30,0:33:21.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在可是白天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's daytime!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.30,0:34:22.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.31,0:35:42.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.31,0:35:45.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 慢着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Whoa! Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.31,0:35:47.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是警察 对不起?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police officer. I'm sorry, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.32,0:35:50.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是警察 我不是故意的 门没有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Police officer. I didn't mean to scare you. The front door was open.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.32,0:35:54.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 有什么事?  - 这是例行巡逻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you doing in here?  - I'm just here on a routine check.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.32,0:35:58.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是42分局的克雷格警官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I'm Officer Krieger, 42nd precinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.33,0:36:01.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是卡伦·杰森?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're Karen Jenson, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.26,0:36:07.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,医院说你昨晚遭人绑架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your coworkers at the hospital said that you were kidnapped last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.27,0:36:09.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.27,0:36:14.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,另一名医生呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to the other doctor I was with?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.28,0:36:16.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,韦勃·寇特斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Curtis Webb?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.28,0:36:18.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He died.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.28,0:36:22.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不必替他担心?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry about that right now, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.28,0:36:23.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.28,0:36:26.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为你也死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you're dead, too, you bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.29,0:36:31.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,可恶 这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.30,0:36:36.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是大蒜吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this, garlic?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.30,0:36:38.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,对 他说能对付吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. He said it would work against vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.30,0:36:40.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampires?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.30,0:36:44.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,谁说我是吸血鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who said I was a vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.31,0:36:46.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.31,0:36:53.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是亲鬼族…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a familiar...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.31,0:36:55.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,一心想当吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a vampire wannabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.32,0:37:00.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,要是他能证明自己... 够忠心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he's loyal... and he proves himself,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.44,0:37:04.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,主人也许会让他变吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe his master will turn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.26,0:37:07.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等 你拿我当诱饵?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. You used me as bait?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.26,0:37:09.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,看开点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.27,0:37:15.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,有这必要吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is all that necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.27,0:37:23.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是吸血族的记号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a glyph... a vampire cattle brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.28,0:37:26.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,克雷格警官是某人的奴才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means that Officer Krieger is somebody's property.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.28,0:37:29.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,要是他受到其他吸血鬼欺负...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another vampire tries to bleed this little hooker...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.28,0:37:32.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,主人就会出面解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then they have to answer to his owner.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.79,0:37:38.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,狄肯·弗劳斯特 我们一直在找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deacon Frost. We've been tracking him for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.29,0:37:39.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.29,0:37:43.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,克雷格警官 当个好猎犬?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Officer Krieger, you going to be a good little bloodhound, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.30,0:37:46.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,把你主人招出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us what your master's been up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.30,0:37:49.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你抢他 也想抢我吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great, now you robbing him. You going to rob me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.30,0:37:51.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,干这行也得赚钱?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you think we fund this organization?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.31,0:37:54.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们又不是慈善机构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not exactly the March of Dimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.31,0:37:59.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,冒牌货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.25,0:38:06.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,看样子 这小子在送血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like our friend here has been blood running.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.25,0:38:09.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,希邦诊所 我知道这地方 是个血库\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hillbarn clinic. I know this place. It's a blood bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.26,0:38:12.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼开的 每个城市都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Owned by vampires, and there's one in every city.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.26,0:38:15.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,随叫随送 你要送到哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they always deliver. So, where were you taking it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.26,0:38:18.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 你在鬼扯些什么…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you're talking...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.27,0:38:20.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,冷静点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.27,0:38:22.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我再问一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm only going to ask you one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.27,0:38:26.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要送到哪里?  - 他妈的去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where were you taking it?  - Go fuck yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.27,0:38:29.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的才去死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck me? No, you fuck this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.29,0:38:49.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你最好弄清楚状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.30,0:38:51.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,这一切都是表面的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world you live in is just a sugar-coated topping.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.30,0:38:55.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,另外有一个残酷的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is another world beneath it... the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.30,0:39:00.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想活下去就得学着狠下心扣扳机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if you want to survive it you better learn to pull the trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.24,0:39:07.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 等一下 我跟你去  - 你对我没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait a minute. I'm comin' with you.  - You're useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.25,0:39:13.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,我得跟着你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have to stick with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.25,0:39:17.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,这样我才能活下去找到解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way I'll stay alive long enough to find a cure for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.26,0:39:19.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有解药的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.27,0:39:32.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's not going to come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.27,0:39:34.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,他没有那么蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody's that stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.28,0:39:37.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,当你了解他的本性...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you understand the nature of a thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.28,0:39:40.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,就知道他有多蠢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know what it's capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.30,0:40:00.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,克雷格 代号16009\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Krieger. I'm at 16-0-0-9.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.30,0:40:02.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,快接珍珠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.49,0:40:03.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,珍珠在进食\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pearl's feeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.31,0:40:12.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我替弗劳斯特送货时碰到刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got a delivery in progress here and I just had a run-in with Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.32,0:40:19.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们马上撤离诊所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got to clear out that clinic on Hillhurst now!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.34,0:40:43.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,事情有眉目了 那就是吸血鬼的记号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we hit pay dirt. That's a vampire mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.34,0:40:46.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,附近有他们的藏身处…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means there's a safe house around here somewhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.35,0:40:49.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,天亮了就躲起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a place they can go with donors coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.35,0:40:55.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,那些泊车小弟? 全是吸血鬼 门房也是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See the valets over there? They're vampires. So is the doorman...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.36,0:40:58.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,街角的妓女也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the whore on the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.36,0:41:03.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道?  - 看他们的动作...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How can you tell?  - By the way they move...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.30,0:41:05.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,闻他们的味道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the way they smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.30,0:41:10.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,这像是场噩梦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like a bad dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.30,0:41:13.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,今晚 有些人比吸血鬼更危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are worse things out tonight than vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.31,0:41:15.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么人?  - 我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like what?  - Like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.31,0:41:19.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼知识入门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK, vampire anatomy 101.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.31,0:41:21.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,十字架和圣水一点也没有用...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crosses and holy water don't do dick...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.32,0:41:23.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以 忘了你在电影里看到的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so forget what you've seen in the movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.32,0:41:25.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们怕木棍 银钉和阳光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You use a stake, silver, or sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.32,0:41:28.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会用枪吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how to use one of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.32,0:41:30.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,不会 但我学得很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope, but I'll damn sure learn quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.32,0:41:32.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,按掉保险锁 子弹已经上膛…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The safety's off, rounds already chambered...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.33,0:41:34.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,银弹装满蒜精\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}silver hollow point filled with garlic.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.33,0:41:38.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,射中头或心脏 否则你就完蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You aim for the head or the heart. Anything else is your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.33,0:41:42.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有邀请函吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have an invitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.33,0:42:51.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 入口在哪里?  - 我不能说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where's the entrance?  - I can't tell you that, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.34,0:42:57.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我再问一次 入口呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to ask you one more time. Where's the entrance?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.34,0:42:58.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 好啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK. OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.35,0:43:02.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,在冰箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in the freezer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.29,0:43:15.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了 入口在冰箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, man! I told you! It's in the fridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.31,0:43:27.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,传话给弗劳斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give Frost a message from me.
