Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.33,0:53:51.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想起来了 刀锋 你欠我一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to think of it, Blade, I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.34,0:53:59.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,严格说起来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Actually, if you want to get technical...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.34,0:54:02.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你欠我两次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.28,0:54:08.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,有什么好笑的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's so funny, bright eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.28,0:54:11.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的伙伴来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm expecting company.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.30,0:54:31.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 逮个你们正着?  - 不 别开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Catch you fuckers at a bad time?  - No! No guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.31,0:54:43.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,笨蛋 这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Fuckin' this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.32,0:54:53.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,放下枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the guns!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.33,0:54:54.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我需要他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need him!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.33,0:54:57.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,抓活的 快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants Blade alive! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.33,0:55:04.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你一直都在听?  - 我们保持聊络\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Ya've been listenin' in the whole time?  - Keepin' radio contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.27,0:55:08.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我才不会让他独闯的?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Think I'd let him run loose without a chaperone?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.28,0:55:18.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我太老了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Christ! I'm too old for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.29,0:55:21.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我得坐轮椅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody get me a goddamn wheelchair.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.30,0:55:33.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,他能照顾自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can take care of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.30,0:55:34.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,快跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.32,0:56:57.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你打算怎样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.32,0:57:00.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.27,0:57:16.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.27,0:57:20.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,脱臼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's dislocated.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.28,0:57:24.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.29,0:57:38.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来...  - 不用 走开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let me give you...  - No! Get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.31,0:57:57.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你也是吸血鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're one of them, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.31,0:58:02.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是 我不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.26,0:58:13.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,当年他才十三岁 流落街头...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found him when he was 13. He'd been livin' on the streets...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.26,0:58:15.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸流浪汉的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}feedin' off the homeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.26,0:58:19.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不吸血就活不下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His need for blood had taken hold at puberty.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.27,0:58:22.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以为他是吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took him for a vampire at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.27,0:58:28.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,差点杀了他 后来才搞清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost killed him, too. Then I realized what he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.27,0:58:33.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,他母亲怀孕时被吸血鬼咬到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade's mother was attacked by a vampire while she was pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.28,0:58:35.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,她死了 而他却活了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She died, but he lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.28,0:58:40.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,可是他的基因发生突变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, he'd undergone certain genetic changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.29,0:58:43.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不怕大蒜 银...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can withstand garlic, silver...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.29,0:58:46.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,连阳光都不怕...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even sunlight...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.29,0:58:49.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,他有吸血鬼的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he's got their strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.30,0:58:53.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的伤口明天就能愈合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time tomorrow, all his wounds will be healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.30,0:58:57.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,他像人类一样会衰老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He still ages like a human, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.30,0:59:00.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼却衰老得很慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampires age slower than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.31,0:59:05.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,不幸的是 他遗传吸血鬼的嗜血性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, he also inherited their thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.25,0:59:10.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以为血清能抑制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought the serum was supposed to suppress that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.25,0:59:12.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,时间一久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time's runnin' out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.25,0:59:16.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的身体产生抵抗力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His body's startin' to reject it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.26,0:59:21.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,我一直找不到解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So far, all my efforts to find a cure have failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.27,0:59:27.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你为何猎杀他们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you hunt them?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.27,0:59:31.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我曾有过家庭…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a family once...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.27,0:59:34.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,妻子和两个女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a wife and 2 daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.28,0:59:39.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,有一天来了个流浪汉...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then a drifter came callin' one evenin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.28,0:59:41.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.28,0:59:44.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,他先玩弄她们...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He toyed with 'em first...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.29,0:59:49.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,逼我决定让哪一个先死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tried to make me decide which order they'd die in.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.29,0:59:57.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们下手绝不留情 不过越打越辛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We kill as many of 'em as we can find, but it's gettin' worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.30,0:59:59.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为弗劳斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because of Frost.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.30,1:00:03.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼族内部发生权力争斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's somethin' happenin' in the vampire ranks.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.30,1:00:05.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,会有一场大乱...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's somethin' big...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.31,1:00:11.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我打赌那臭小子一定是祸源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'd stake my life that son of a bitch is at the center of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.36,1:00:14.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.33,1:00:35.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,惠斯勒都告诉我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whistler told me what happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.34,1:00:40.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你的身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me what you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.34,1:00:48.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不知道 你根本就不了解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't know me. You don't know anything about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.35,1:00:52.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不是人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not human.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.36,1:01:00.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你像是个人类  - 人类不会吸血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You look human to me...  - Humans don't drink blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.36,1:01:02.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是以前的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.30,1:01:07.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你应该忘了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you should let that go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.30,1:01:14.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在寻找害死我母亲的那个吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've spent my whole life lookin' for that thing that killed my mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.31,1:01:16.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我变成现在这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It made me what I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.31,1:01:23.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,每次除掉一个吸血鬼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And every time I take one of those monsters out...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.32,1:01:26.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我就更接近人类...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I get a little piece of that life back...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.32,1:01:29.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,别叫我忘了它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so don't you tell me about forgetting.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.33,1:01:35.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,他让我们措手不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He took us by surprise!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.33,1:01:37.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们两个人解决了你所有的保安?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two of them against your entire security force?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.33,1:01:40.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,别都怪在我头上 你当时也在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't put that shit on me, 'cause you were there, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.33,1:01:42.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想狄肯会感激的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure Deacon will appreciate...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.34,1:01:44.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,...我可是还挨了一刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...stabbed in the balls for it, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.34,1:01:45.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,你这小贱货\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You little skeez!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.34,1:01:47.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你断手是活该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't see the lifestyle really suits you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.34,1:01:49.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,小心我把你揍扁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should put this stump through that shit-eating grin of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.34,1:01:54.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,面对现实吧 你太差劲了 算你活该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Face it. You were sloppy. You got what you deserved.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.35,1:02:00.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,狄肯 让我宰了那家伙 你看他对我做了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deacon, let me take this guy out. Look what he fuckin' did!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.35,1:02:04.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他又砍断我的手  - 听我说 我要活捉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He took my hand again!  - Listen to me. I want him alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.29,1:02:07.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的在说什么呀 活捉?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck are you talk... You want him alive?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.29,1:02:10.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们一直想除掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been tryin' to kill this motherfucker for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.30,1:02:13.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的疯了不成?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you out of your fuckin' mind?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.30,1:02:15.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,傻瓜 别紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Big guy, relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.30,1:02:18.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,耐心等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be patient.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.31,1:02:22.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们有得忙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, we got a lot to do here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.31,1:02:24.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.31,1:02:29.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我需要你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.29,1:03:15.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,早安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.29,1:03:17.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you feelin'?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.31,1:03:28.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.31,1:03:35.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,天气挺热的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whew. Gettin' a little toasty out here, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.31,1:03:40.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有多久 没看过日出了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When was the last time you stopped to appreciate a good sunrise?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.32,1:03:42.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,对了 你天生是吸血鬼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's right. You were born a vampire...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.32,1:03:44.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以你从没看过日出 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so you never had the pleasure, have you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.32,1:03:47.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's OK. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.33,1:03:50.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起分享这一刻...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Least we're here together. Share the moment...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.33,1:03:53.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得很感动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which means a lot to me by the way, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.33,1:03:59.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,是真的 若你能多了解我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean that. 'Cause actually, when you get to know me...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.34,1:04:02.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,就会知道我的感情丰富\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a fairly sentimental type of guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.28,1:04:05.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且有点天真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bit of an innocent, you might say.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.28,1:04:09.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要什么 弗劳斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what you want, Frost.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.28,1:04:13.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,这不重要了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't make any difference.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.29,1:04:16.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你就是他妈的不明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just don't fuckin' get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.29,1:04:21.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你不能成为纯种吸血鬼  - 抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You're never gonna be a pureblood.  - Hold him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.30,1:04:25.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你统治不了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will never rule us!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.31,1:04:40.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,老天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.31,1:04:44.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 祝你愉快  - 抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Have a nice day.  - Sorry, you old dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.32,1:04:47.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你太伶牙俐齿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just got a little too long in the tooth.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.32,1:04:50.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,干嘛 很好笑呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, man? That was funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.32,1:04:52.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,伶牙利齿 真好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Long, tooth." Funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.33,1:04:55.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我和你说过...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I tell you the one about...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.29,1:05:26.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你把盖塔罗怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you done with Dragonetti?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.30,1:05:35.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们谈正事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get down to business, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.30,1:05:37.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要十二名志愿者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need 12 volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.32,1:05:51.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.32,1:05:54.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,好像有人用来擦屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smells like a vampire wiped his ass with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.32,1:05:57.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 资料库拿来的  - 用血写的字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I took it from the archives.  - It's written in blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.32,1:06:00.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是死亡之书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's from The Book of Erebus.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.26,1:06:07.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,弗劳斯特一直在翻译\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's what Frost has been workin' on.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.27,1:06:11.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,跟血神和十二天王有关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's somethin' about the Blood God the Spirits ofthe Twelve.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.27,1:06:14.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,其他的看不出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I can't make out the rest of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.27,1:06:16.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许这有帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe this'll help.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.28,1:06:18.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我会查出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll figure out something.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.28,1:06:21.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,这些是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what's all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.28,1:06:23.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,昨晚我回医院一趟...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took a trip to the hospital last night...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.28,1:06:25.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,借来一些仪器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}borrowed some equipment.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.29,1:06:28.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的神奇解药?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For your miracle cure?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.29,1:06:33.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是抗血凝剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is E.D.T.A. It's an anticoagulant.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.29,1:06:36.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,用来治疗血块\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We use it to treat blood clots.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.30,1:06:38.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,看看会发生什么 我把它滴入...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now look what happens when I introduce it...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.30,1:06:41.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼的血液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}onto a sample of vampire blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.30,1:06:44.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,退后一步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a step back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.30,1:06:46.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,会引起强烈反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The reaction's energetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.31,1:06:59.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 好厉害的解药  - 抗血凝剂不是解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Some cure.  - I didn't say E.D.T.A. was a cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.32,1:07:04.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,你能用来轰掉吸血鬼的脑袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But maybe you could use it to explode some vampire heads.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.26,1:07:09.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,等等 我要抽点你的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait a minute. I need a sample ofyour blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.26,1:07:12.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,待会吧 我得到市中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Later. Gotta go downtown.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.27,1:07:16.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我需要血清  - 先别急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Need some serum.  - Serum can wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.27,1:07:18.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,这很重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is important.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.29,1:07:42.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 他病了?  - 癌症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is he sick?  - Cancer.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.30,1:07:47.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们感情很好 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a lot of love for him, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.30,1:07:49.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们合作无间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a good arrangement.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.30,1:07:52.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,他制造武器 我则大展身手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He makes the weapons. I use 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.31,1:07:58.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我母亲常说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My mother used to say...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.31,1:08:01.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,哀莫大于心死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"a cold heart is a dead heart."
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.26,1:08:21.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的脸色很差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't look so good.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.27,1:08:23.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只是有点累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just a little tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.27,1:08:27.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们忙了一整晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know we've been workin' all night.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.28,1:08:32.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有及时阻止你的变化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess we didn't catch it in time.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.28,1:08:35.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你只剩一天...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got another day...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.28,1:08:37.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,最多两天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two at the most.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.29,1:08:44.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我感到很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For what it's worth, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.29,1:08:48.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,听起来 你好像把我当成了死人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You make it sound like I'm already dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.27,1:09:33.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好吗 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doin', chief?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.27,1:09:35.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,别乱来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.28,1:09:39.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,别让小朋友...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wouldn't want our little friend here...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.28,1:09:43.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,成为失踪儿童\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to wind up on the back of a milk carton, would we?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.28,1:09:49.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴终于见到你 我一直在注意你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nice to finally meet you. Had my eye on you for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.29,1:09:54.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我把你摸透了 血清 惠斯勒 我都一清二楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know all about you... your serum, Whistler... everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.29,1:09:58.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 防晒油  - 这只是暂时的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sunblock.  - Hey, it's a start, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.30,1:10:03.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想要成为你这种人... 日行者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The goal, of course, is to be like you... the daywalker.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.30,1:10:06.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,两种人的好处都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got the best of both worlds, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.31,1:10:10.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有我们的优点 没有缺点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All our strengths none of our weaknesses.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.31,1:10:13.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可不这么想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe I don't see it that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.31,1:10:16.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,别假装你是人类?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, so it's back to pretending we're human again?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.32,1:10:20.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,少来这套 别当叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Spare me the Uncle Tom routine, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.32,1:10:23.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,别忘了自己的本性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't keep denying what you are, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.32,1:10:27.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,人类会接受你这个杂种吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think the humans will ever accept a half-breed like you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.33,1:10:30.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,不会的 他们害怕你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can't. They're afraid ofyou.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.33,1:10:32.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是应该的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they should be.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.33,1:10:36.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是只该死的发狂野兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an animal. You're a fuckin' maniac.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.34,1:10:42.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,看看他们 全都是肉牛...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at 'em. They're cattle...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.34,1:10:44.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pieces of meat.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.34,1:10:47.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,管他们这么多干嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What difference does it make how their world ends?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.35,1:10:51.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,瘟疫 战争 饥荒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plague, war, famine.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.35,1:10:54.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,别谈什么仁义道德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morality doesn't even enter into it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.35,1:10:58.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们是物竞天择的结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're just a function of natural selection, man...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.36,1:11:00.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,全新人种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the new race.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.36,1:11:03.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的妆糊掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like your mascara's running.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.30,1:11:14.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要跟你握手言和 我要你加入我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm offering you a truce. I want you with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.31,1:11:17.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你当我是白痴吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.59,1:11:19.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,十二天王
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.09,1:11:23.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,将唤醒血神
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.32,1:11:27.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道血神的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're familiar with the Blood God.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.30,1:11:28.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,弗劳斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frost.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.32,1:11:31.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,对我来说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're nothing to me...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.32,1:11:35.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你只是一个死吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but another dead vampire.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.33,1:11:38.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,你很傻 知道吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're an idiot. You know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.33,1:11:41.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想饶你一条小命...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came down here offering you an easy way out...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.33,1:11:45.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的却不知好歹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you spit it right back in my fuckin' face.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.34,1:11:47.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,别乱来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.34,1:11:54.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,我才不管她死活? 他们只是食物...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I care? They're nothing but cattle...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.35,1:11:57.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像你说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just like you said.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.35,1:12:00.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想来硬的尽管来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you wanna take the hard road, be my guest...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.35,1:12:03.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过我向你保证 当这一切结束的时候...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I promise you, by the time this is over...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.29,1:12:08.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你会求生不得求死不能…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're gonna wish they never cut you from your mother's...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.33,1:12:43.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,快回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.33,1:12:48.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,很简单 吸血鬼为何吸血?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was simple. Why do vampires need to drink blood?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.33,1:12:51.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们无法吸收血红素\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause their own blood can't sustain hemoglobin.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.34,1:12:54.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,这跟溶血性贫血一样是遗传病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. It's a genetic defect, just like hemolytic anemia.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.34,1:12:57.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,也就是说 我们一定要用基因治疗法...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That means that we have to treat it with gene therapy...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.34,1:13:00.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,用还原病毒更改遗传基因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rewrite the victim's DNA with a retrovirus.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.35,1:13:03.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,镰状细胞性贫血也是这么治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've been using it on sickle cell anemia.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.28,1:13:06.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这安全吗?  - 不知道...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you sure that's safe?  - I have no idea...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.29,1:13:09.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,可是我别无选择?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I don't have a choice, do l?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.29,1:13:17.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 你真的认为有效?  - 对我来说... 有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You actually think this could work?  - On me... yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.30,1:13:19.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,对刀锋来说就不一定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On Blade, I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.30,1:13:22.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,他不像我是被吸血鬼咬到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't contract vampirism from a bite like I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.30,1:13:26.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是天生的 这是他的遗传基因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was born with it. It's part of his DNA.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.31,1:13:30.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我能治好嗜血症 得花点时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure I can cure his thirst, but it's gonna take time.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.31,1:13:32.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, we're out oftime.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.31,1:13:36.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你看到磁盘的内容\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saw what was on that disk.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.32,1:13:42.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.32,1:13:45.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,快离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:11.28,1:14:13.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你快离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.29,1:14:22.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,很棒的地方 挺难找的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice place. Took us a while to find it!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.30,1:14:34.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 快咬我吧  - 我不会咬你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Bite me and get it over with.  - I ain't gonna bite you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.32,1:14:48.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,交给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do your thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.14,1:15:01.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,惠斯勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whistler.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.27,1:16:11.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,她被弗劳斯特抓走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frost took her.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.28,1:16:21.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.28,1:16:25.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,磁盘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The disk.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.28,1:16:27.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,被我们破解了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He decoded it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.29,1:16:30.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,弗劳斯特想要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frost is trying to...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.29,1:16:34.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,造成世界末日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trigger a fuckin' vampire apocalypse.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.30,1:16:38.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,他一直想要...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's some kind of...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.30,1:16:42.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,让吸血鬼的神复活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}vampire God he's trying to resurrect.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.30,1:16:45.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,血神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}La Magra.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.31,1:16:50.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你就是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.31,1:16:53.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,他需要你的血...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He needs your blood...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.32,1:17:00.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,一个日行者的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the blood of the daywalker.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.25,1:17:04.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是血神的选民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the chosen one.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.26,1:17:10.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.26,1:17:14.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 别去找他  - 办不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You can't go after him.  - Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.27,1:17:17.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你若落在弗劳斯特手上...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Frost gets his hands on you...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.27,1:17:19.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,人类就会灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.27,1:17:26.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸血族将占领地球\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There'll be armies ofthe motherfuckers.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.28,1:17:29.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,可恶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.29,1:17:36.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你一定要把我杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have to finish me off.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.29,1:17:40.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,别让我变吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't want me coming back.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.29,1:17:43.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,先治好你的伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can treat the wounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.30,1:17:46.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我没有救了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too far gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.30,1:17:49.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know that.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.30,1:17:54.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,把枪给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.95,1:17:57.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.31,1:18:00.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,把你的枪给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the goddamn gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.27,1:18:30.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,给我滚吧 臭小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now walk away, you stupid son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.28,1:18:36.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Walk the fuck away.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.30,1:19:02.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,当你看到这个的时候 惠斯勒应该早就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the time you watch this, your friend Whistler should be dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.24,1:19:05.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要知道 他死命抵抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it makes any difference to you, he put up quite a fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.24,1:19:09.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,你能在埃奇伍德塔找到我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can find us at the Edgewood Towers.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.34,1:20:50.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好像有点拘束 你太紧张...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem a bit tense. A bit pent-up maybe...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.35,1:20:53.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,得发泄一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iike you need to release something.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.35,1:20:57.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是吗? 刀锋没有让你爽到吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know? Blade not givin' it to you maybe?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.36,1:21:02.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想不透...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.29,1:21:05.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是个大美女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see such a beautiful woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.30,1:21:08.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,皮肤这么嫩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great skin.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.30,1:21:12.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只想让你快乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to see you happy, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.30,1:21:16.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要把我变成吸血鬼?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this the part where you offer to turn me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.31,1:21:20.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,要不然就得杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's either that or a body bag.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.31,1:21:23.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,来呀 尽管咬我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead. Bite me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.32,1:21:25.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll just cure myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.32,1:21:28.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,上次能治好 这次也行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did it before, and I can do it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.32,1:21:33.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 没有解药的 宝贝  - 被咬到就有...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There is no cure, baby.  - There is if you've been bitten...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.33,1:21:35.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要你曾是个人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you were once human.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.33,1:21:44.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会有伤疤 狄肯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you get that scar, Deacon?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.34,1:21:47.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,天生的吸血鬼不会有伤疤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A born vampire would have the power to regenerate from birth.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.34,1:21:50.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你一定是后来才变的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must've gotten scarred before you were turned.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.34,1:21:52.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,对不对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.34,1:21:55.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不是真的吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampires like you aren't a species.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.35,1:22:00.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,你只是受到感染 像是性病或是病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're just infected a virus, a sexually transmitted disease.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.35,1:22:02.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道我们是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what we are, sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.29,1:22:06.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们是世界的主宰 血神要降临...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the top ofthe fuckin' food chain. The Blood God's coming...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.29,1:22:09.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,今晚过后 人类将灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and after tonight, you people are fuckin' history.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.29,1:22:13.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,血神就像一阵龙卷风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a hurricane, an act of God.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.30,1:22:18.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,碰到它就会变成吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone caught in his path will instantly be turned.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.30,1:22:23.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的朋友 亲人 都不能幸免\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone you've ever known... everyone you've ever fucking loved.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.31,1:22:27.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,不管是纯种或是杂种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't matter who's pureblood and who's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.31,1:22:31.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你能救全世界吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How are you gonna cure the whole fuckin' world?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.32,1:22:39.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋的血是关键\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And Blade's blood is the key.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.32,1:22:41.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,有人闯进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got an intruder.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.29,1:23:12.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不了解 他很厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you understand. This dude is fuckin' bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.29,1:23:16.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,二十个人都挡不了 他会丢刀子什么的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had 20 guys around him... and he's got shit he throws at you...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.29,1:23:17.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 丢旋风刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the swords.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.30,1:23:19.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且耍得哧哧叫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Throw it in the air, catch it underneath.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.30,1:23:21.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的给我闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Shut the fuck up!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.30,1:23:23.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,目前没发现入侵者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no intruder where we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.30,1:23:28.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,搞定他 明白吗? 他只有一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, make it happen, all right? It's one guy on foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.31,1:23:32.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,他来了 抓住他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's him! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.33,1:23:54.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么会有枪声?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why am I hearing gunfire?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.33,1:23:59.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说过 我要活捉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I tell anybody to start shooting? I need him alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.27,1:24:04.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.28,1:24:06.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不是吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just work for them!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.28,1:24:11.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 老天 全面封锁  - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jesus Christ. Lock this place down.  - Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.32,1:25:59.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.27,1:26:13.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不是死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you died.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.27,1:26:17.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,那天晚上 我就活过来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came back, Eric. That very same night...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.28,1:26:22.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,狄肯完全接纳我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when Deacon welcomed me into his arms.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.30,1:26:41.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你会很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ. I thought you'd be happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.30,1:26:45.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好不容易和母亲团聚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're finally reunited, and you act like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.30,1:26:48.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋 投降吧 你玩完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade, give it up. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.31,1:26:50.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,她是我的 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She belongs to me, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.31,1:26:55.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,别这么吃惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look so surprised.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.31,1:26:57.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你一生在找...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You spent your whole life...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.32,1:27:00.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,咬你老妈的吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Iooking for the vampire who bit your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.32,1:27:02.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,就是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.26,1:27:08.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,没想到你会活下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who would ever guess you'd survive your mother's death?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.26,1:27:11.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们又聚在一起…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you did. And here we are...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.26,1:27:14.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,幸福快乐的一家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one big happy fuckin' family.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.28,1:27:27.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,我需要血清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need my serum.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.28,1:27:32.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,我逃出去就注射你的解药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe when we get outta this, I'll take that miracle cure of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.28,1:27:34.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,但是会有副作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's one catch.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.29,1:27:40.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,若是有效...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it works...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.29,1:27:45.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,你将失去超人力量和重生能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll lose your strength and your ability to regenerate.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.30,1:27:49.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,完全变成人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll be completely human.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.67,1:28:52.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋 卡伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade, Karen
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.30,1:28:57.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 欢迎你们大驾光临  - 谢谢你的墨镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Glad you could make it.  - Thanks for the shades.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.30,1:29:04.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的祖先称它为永夜殿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our ancestors called this place the temple of eternal night.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.24,1:29:08.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,很棒吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.25,1:29:12.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,这些天才忘了有这地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, these geniuses forgot it ever existed.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.25,1:29:14.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,幸好...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fortunately for us...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.25,1:29:18.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很爱钻研历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm what you might call a student of history.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.27,1:29:34.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,为什么来这?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are we here?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:35.84,1:29:39.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,永夜殿是为了这一刻而建…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This temple was built for one glorious moment...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.84,1:29:42.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,今天晚上 迎接血神降临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this night, for the Blood God.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.86,1:29:52.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.86,1:30:00.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我看看你的剑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see this sword ofyours.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.87,1:30:07.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,钛合金打造? 精心雕刻?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Titanium, right? Acid-etched?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.87,1:30:12.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,真的很好用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get used to a weapon like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.88,1:30:18.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.88,1:30:21.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,你好像很吃惊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look surprised.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.89,1:30:25.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说过 刀锋 我对你一清二楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, Blade, I know everything about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.89,1:30:30.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 伸出手 昆恩  - 为什么? 我的手好得很\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hold out your arm, Quinn.  - Why, man? They're, like, all better.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.90,1:30:32.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,伸出手 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold out your arm. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.90,1:30:38.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,狄肯 我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deacon, l...
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.91,1:30:44.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,开个玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just kidding.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.91,1:30:48.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,他在耍我 他妈的只是在耍我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was fuckin' with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.53,1:30:53.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.72,1:30:57.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,他只想要吸血 听不见你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can't hear you, honey. The thirst has got him now.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.86,1:31:06.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么? 你的血清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do we have here? The precious serum.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.87,1:31:13.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你有多久没有注射了? 十二或十三个钟头?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long's it been since you shot up? 12, 13 hours maybe?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.87,1:31:17.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,你一定很想吸血?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet you're just dying for a drink, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.88,1:31:21.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,感觉如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it feel like?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.88,1:31:26.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 全身的血在沸腾?  - 你试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Is your blood on fire?  - Try some.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.88,1:31:28.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,你也许会喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.89,1:31:32.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢了 我爱吸鲜血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, but I prefer the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.89,1:31:34.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,反正...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In any event...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.89,1:31:38.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不再需要它了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you'll be needing these anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.90,1:31:46.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a shame, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.90,1:31:49.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,你本来是吸血鬼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I think ofwhat you've become...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.91,1:31:53.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在却变成这样 这不能怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what you should have become. I guess I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.91,1:31:55.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,所有的一切...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, with everything that's happened...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.91,1:31:58.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,都是人类的弱点在作祟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's the human side ofyou that's made you weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.92,1:32:00.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,你应该回归本性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should've listened to your blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.92,1:32:02.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,随便你怎么说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Say what you want...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.85,1:32:06.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,日出前你一定会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but, I promise you, you'll be dead by dawn.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:09.86,1:32:11.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,把他带出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get him outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.87,1:32:18.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,把那些浑蛋带下去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get these fucks downstairs. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.87,1:32:20.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.87,1:32:22.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.88,1:32:29.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,别担心 甜心 我没忘记你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, sweetheart. We haven't forgotten about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.88,1:32:30.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no, baby.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.88,1:32:34.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我对你有很特别的安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got something real special planned for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.89,1:32:37.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,那冲浪小子的屁股真翘 我把他吸干了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That surfer boy had a nice ass. I sucked him dry.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.89,1:32:40.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 这家伙被我吸后应该会变  - 可是他并没变吸血鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you'd figure he'd turn, man.  - Yeah, but he didn't turn, did he?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.89,1:32:45.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有 但他却变成僵尸 有时是会这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. He turned into some kinda zombie. It happens sometimes, cutie.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.90,1:32:47.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,他被吓呆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was fuckin' tripped out.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.90,1:32:48.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,真可怜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.90,1:32:51.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,这种人渣什么都吃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These guys are complete scum. They'll eat anything...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.90,1:32:56.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,动物 老鼠 尸体 有时候...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}animals, rodents, corpses, and sometimes...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.91,1:32:59.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 连吸血鬼都吃  - 那最好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- they'll even eat vampires.  - That's a plus.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.91,1:33:01.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,说了这么多...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And bearing that all in mind...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:01.91,1:33:05.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在要你见见老朋友了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like you to meet an old friend of yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.85,1:33:12.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,真可惜 我挺喜欢她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too bad. I kinda liked her.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.86,1:33:14.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,真是浪费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.88,1:33:38.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道我是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what's happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.88,1:33:40.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有脉博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No pulse.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.89,1:33:44.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,而且肤色很苍白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And, of course there's the question of lividity.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.90,1:33:47.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,寇特斯?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Curtis?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.21,1:33:53.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,卡伦?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karen?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.71,1:33:55.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,卡伦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Karen.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.90,1:33:59.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,没想到会再见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never thought I would see you again.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.90,1:34:04.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 卡伦 你有没有后悔跟我分手?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, Karen do you ever have second thoughts about us?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:39.87,1:35:41.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor child.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.87,1:35:44.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,你病得很重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're so sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.88,1:35:47.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,饥渴欲狂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.88,1:35:50.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.88,1:35:55.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克 看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric, look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.89,1:36:00.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在我是吸血族的一份子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampires are my people now. I'm one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.89,1:36:03.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't be.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:04.83,1:36:06.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,我当然是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, it can.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.83,1:36:10.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你要知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try to understand, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:11.84,1:36:14.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,你母亲早就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mother died a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.84,1:36:19.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,我杀过人...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've hunted...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.85,1:36:22.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,吸过血...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've killed...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.85,1:36:26.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I've enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.85,1:36:29.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不喜欢吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.86,1:36:32.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,你一定喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you have.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.86,1:36:38.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,你一定会变成吸血鬼的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sooner or later, the thirst always wins.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.84,1:37:24.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.85,1:37:32.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,叫他们站好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spread them out.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.85,1:37:35.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,每个记号上站一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One on each glyph, under the towers.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:35.85,1:37:37.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,一定要站好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make it perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:18.83,1:38:20.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,把电梯叫上来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring the elevator up.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.87,1:39:01.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,傻姑娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stupid girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.87,1:39:05.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真以为 血神会降临吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think is going to happen? La Magra? The Blood God?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.81,1:39:08.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,那只是吸血鬼的童话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a fairy tale for pretty little vampires.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.81,1:39:11.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,你干嘛这么害怕?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why are you sweating, pureblood?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:11.82,1:39:14.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,怕我偷走你的灵魂...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're afraid we're gonna steal your soul...
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.82,1:39:16.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,纯种吸血鬼的精华?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your pureblood spirit?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.82,1:39:20.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,你应该害怕 去读预言吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be. Read the prophecy.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.82,1:39:25.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们该有所贡献了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time you fucks contributed something to the cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.83,1:39:32.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,就算弗劳斯特说得没错 他才不理你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if Frost is right, you really think he cares about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:32.84,1:39:36.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你死定了 就像我们一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna die just like the rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.41,1:40:02.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.88,1:40:15.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,今晚人类将灭亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tonight, the age of man comes to an end.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.88,1:40:17.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,不能妥协\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more compromises.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.88,1:40:19.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们会成为神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're gonna be gods.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:20.88,1:40:22.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.89,1:40:29.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要当恶神 我要当邪恶的吸血神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna be naughty. I'm gonna be a naughty vampire god.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.90,1:40:39.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,一定要阻止...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotta stop...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.90,1:40:41.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,阻止...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stop...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.91,1:40:43.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,省点力气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save your strength.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.91,1:40:50.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的体温过低 会流血致死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hypovolemic. You're bleeding to death.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.91,1:40:52.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我需要... 血清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need... serum.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.75,1:41:12.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.25,1:41:15.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.88,1:41:19.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.88,1:41:23.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要你吸我的血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to take some of my blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.26,1:41:26.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.26,1:41:30.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.89,1:41:33.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,快吸吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.77,1:41:38.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,把你的臭手拿开
Dialogue: 0,1:41:58.92,1:42:04.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,大家渴了吗? 希望你们都很渴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is everybody thirsty? I hope you're all very fucking thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.88,1:42:26.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.88,1:42:31.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,继续吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.89,1:42:37.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要停\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.90,1:42:53.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,继续吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.89,1:43:47.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,滋味如何?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.37,1:44:59.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,艾力克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eric.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.90,1:45:01.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是你母亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your mother.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.83,1:45:06.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不会杀我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't hurt your mother...
Dialogue: 0,1:45:06.84,1:45:08.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:10.84,1:45:12.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.85,1:45:18.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要解除你的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must release you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:35.43,1:46:36.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,狄肯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deacon.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.86,1:46:38.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不再是狄肯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.52,1:46:56.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,弗劳斯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Frost!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:56.88,1:46:59.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 杀了他  - 慢着 你欠我的 老兄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kill him.  - Wait! I owe you, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.88,1:47:01.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有两只手 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got two new hands, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.89,1:47:05.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道该用哪只杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know which one to use to kill you with!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:47.86,1:48:50.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀了你一定很爽快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm really going to enjoy this now.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:38.69,1:49:39.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:42.85,1:49:44.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,决斗吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.90,1:50:39.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,你太迟了 刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're too late, Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.92,1:51:00.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,轮到我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.88,1:51:29.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,看看你 你这个婊子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at you. You're a little bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.89,1:51:34.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的血清? 帮不了你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, your serum? It can't help you now, stud.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.90,1:51:43.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,好准头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.86,1:52:19.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,有些笨蛋硬是学不了乖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some motherfuckers are always trying to ice-skate uphill.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:51.65,1:52:52.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,刀锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blade.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:00.91,1:53:02.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:38.88,1:53:43.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,要把你治好就得回实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to get back to the lab if I'm going to cure you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:43.89,1:53:45.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,事情还没有结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not over.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.89,1:53:47.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,解药留着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You keep your cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.89,1:53:53.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有一场硬仗 我得再度出击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's still a war going on and I have a job to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:53.90,1:53:57.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,你想帮忙 那就做更好的血清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to help make me a better serum.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.92,1:54:10.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,(莫斯科)
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.72,1:54:37.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,好冷哦
Dialogue: 0,1:54:37.22,1:54:38.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们去哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.72,1:54:39.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是个惊喜
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.85,1:54:41.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,惊喜
Dialogue: 0,1:54:42.36,1:54:44.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我最爱惊喜
Dialogue: 0,1:54:44.36,1:54:46.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,你一定会喜欢这个的
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.88,1:55:03.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,我逮个你正着
Dialogue: 0,1:55:04.88,1:55:06.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,同志
